{"symbol":"FAB.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:50:19Z","info":{"address1":"Ul. Domaniewska 44a","city":"Warsaw","zip":"02-672","country":"Poland","phone":"48 22 448 7000","fax":"48 22 101 0577","website":"https://www.fabrity.com","industry":"Software - Application","industryKey":"software-application","industryDisp":"Software - Application","sector":"Technology","sectorKey":"technology","sectorDisp":"Technology","longBusinessSummary":"Fabrity S.A. engages in the production of technological solutions in Poland. The company offers enterprise software and web and mobile development, legacy system modernization, and digital transformation; data engineering services, including data ingestion and integration; central data lake/data platform; data processing and standardization; ml training environment; production model serving; and data and model monitoring; and generative AI. It also designs and build blockchain business applications. In addition, the company offers Nexen Suite, an industrial IoT platform designed for industry, smart cities, and large enterprises; Azure development services comprising Azure AI Services, Azure Internet of Things (IoT), Azure Cloud architecture and consulting, Azure Infrastructure as a Service, Azure Platform as a Service, and Azure Software as a Service; and digital solutions. Further, it provides B2C eCommerce development, B2B eCommerce development, migration, maintenance, UX/UI audit, eCommerce CRO, code audit, team extension, and PIM; and low-code solutions. The company serves life science, healthcare, construction, FMCG, energy and utilities, transportation and logistics, financial services, manufacturing, consumer goods and retail, automotive, and media and communication industries. The company was formerly known as Fabrity Holding S.A. and changed its name to Fabrity S.A. in January 2025. Fabrity S.A. was founded in 1997 and is headquartered in Warsaw, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":280,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"nam